WEBVTT

00:03.207 --> 00:04.227
<b>Huh?</b>

00:04.227 --> 00:05.737
<b>Mother?</b>

00:06.307 --> 00:08.747
<b>What are you two doing here?!</b>

00:08.747 --> 00:09.997
<b>We don't know!</b>

00:09.997 --> 00:12.707
<b>We were just with our king.</b>

00:12.707 --> 00:14.707
<b>H-How did we...</b>

00:22.917 --> 00:24.337
<b>They vanished?</b>

00:24.337 --> 00:25.877
<b>That shouldn't be possible.</b>

00:27.887 --> 00:29.687
<b><i>Caria, can you hear me?</i></b>

00:31.767 --> 00:34.517
<b><i>Caria, Maria, Isla!</i></b>

00:34.517 --> 00:35.477
<b><i>Respond!</i></b>

00:41.147 --> 00:44.607
Communication Error!

00:41.147 --> 00:44.607
You cannot use the chat function at this time.

00:45.367 --> 00:46.477
<b>Why not?!</b>

02:25.547 --> 02:27.007
The Moon is Pretty, Isn't It?

02:34.837 --> 02:35.947
<b>My children!</b>

02:35.947 --> 02:37.677
<b>Protect those girls!</b>

02:41.387 --> 02:42.187
<b>Wha?!</b>

02:43.767 --> 02:44.837
<b>Brain Eaters!</b>

02:44.837 --> 02:45.927
<b>If you can hear me,</b>

02:45.927 --> 02:47.477
<b>then come here right now!</b>

02:50.957 --> 02:52.407
<b>O great and mighty king!</b>

02:52.407 --> 02:54.807
<b>Our leader, Ira Takuto!</b>

02:54.807 --> 02:57.037
<b>Please respond to my voice!</b>

02:58.167 --> 02:59.597
<b>Is everything okay?</b>

02:59.597 --> 03:01.747
<b>What should we do?</b>

03:02.367 --> 03:04.077
<b>You needn't worry.</b>

03:04.677 --> 03:06.857
<b>Let's start by getting out of here.</b>

03:26.657 --> 03:27.587
<b>Huh?</b>

03:28.887 --> 03:30.107
<b>No way!</b>

03:38.877 --> 03:40.117
<b>Sucks for you!</b>

03:40.117 --> 03:43.367
<b>I ain't going to die here!</b>

03:43.367 --> 03:44.277
<b>How?!</b>

03:44.277 --> 03:45.877
<b>I'm certain I killed you!</b>

03:47.977 --> 03:49.507
<b>You can't kill me now.</b>

03:49.857 --> 03:52.037
<b>Hell, I'm already dead anyway!</b>

03:55.297 --> 03:58.507
Auto-Defend Activated!

03:55.297 --> 03:58.507
Key characters are protected

03:55.297 --> 03:58.507
while the event is in progress.

03:58.967 --> 04:00.727
<b>Auto-Defend?</b>

04:00.727 --> 04:02.227
<b>Event in progress?</b>

04:02.977 --> 04:06.807
<b>The events <i>Brave Questus'</i> 
Flamin was involved in were...</b>

04:08.817 --> 04:11.277
You have defeated the Blazing General Flamin!

04:11.817 --> 04:15.777
Gyahahahaha! You thought you won,
 didn't you? Fool!

04:15.777 --> 04:19.007
<b>You thought you won, didn't you?</b>

04:20.967 --> 04:22.267
<b>Fool!</b>

04:22.267 --> 04:23.457
<b>Be quiet!</b>

04:23.837 --> 04:25.327
<b>Mother...</b>

04:25.327 --> 04:28.127
<b>My, my, you're such a worrywart.</b>

04:28.487 --> 04:29.527
<b>It's all right.</b>

04:29.527 --> 04:32.977
<b>I won't allow him to lay a hand on you two.</b>

04:33.667 --> 04:35.197
<b>How tear-jerking.</b>

04:35.197 --> 04:37.387
<b>Such heartwarming love.</b>

04:38.877 --> 04:40.487
<b>Don't be so mad now.</b>

04:40.487 --> 04:42.807
<b>Let's enjoy this time like 
the dumbasses we are.</b>

04:45.047 --> 04:45.847
<b>Wha?!</b>

04:46.807 --> 04:51.067
<b>I've been through this 
over and over like a fool.</b>

04:51.067 --> 04:53.797
<b>Always this same shitty script!</b>

04:54.947 --> 04:56.387
<b>What are you two doing?!</b>

04:56.387 --> 04:58.367
<b>Take cover behind me!</b>

04:58.697 --> 05:01.017
<b>H-Huh? It's not us!</b>

05:01.017 --> 05:03.327
<b>How?! My legs are moving on their own!</b>

05:03.327 --> 05:04.257
<b>Stop!</b>

05:04.257 --> 05:06.277
<b>Please, get back!</b>

05:08.647 --> 05:10.157
<b>Can't fight it, can you?!</b>

05:10.157 --> 05:12.047
<b>Can't defy it, can you?!</b>

05:12.047 --> 05:16.917
<b>Is this one of those RPG mechanics 
Master warned me about?!</b>

05:16.917 --> 05:22.597
<b>Now you get a VIP seat to watch 
as those brats die right here!</b>

05:24.557 --> 05:29.017
<b><i>After the fight against Flamin 
in the </i>Brave Questus<i> RPG...</i></b>

05:32.477 --> 05:35.447
<b>Mother... Wh-What do we do?!</b>

05:35.447 --> 05:37.487
<b>H-Help us!</b>

05:39.407 --> 05:43.907
<b>Don't you dare think you 
can fetter me with this!</b>

05:43.907 --> 05:46.787
<b>Struggling won't help you!</b>

05:47.437 --> 05:49.587
<b>I'll tell you something good though.</b>

05:49.587 --> 05:52.027
<b>I call this goddamned mechanic</b>

05:52.027 --> 05:54.877
<b>a "scripted event."</b>

05:56.017 --> 05:57.217
<b>I'm scared!</b>

05:57.217 --> 05:59.677
<b>No! I don't want to die!</b>

05:59.677 --> 06:00.887
<b>It's all right.</b>

06:00.887 --> 06:03.387
<b>I promise, I promise I'll save you!</b>

06:08.007 --> 06:11.687
<b>Ahh, every last one of you are damn fools!</b>

06:11.687 --> 06:16.147
<b>You all mistakenly believe that you're
acting of your own damn volition!</b>

06:16.147 --> 06:18.077
<b>The Heroes! The Demon Lord!</b>

06:18.077 --> 06:19.447
<b>Everyone and everything!</b>

06:19.447 --> 06:21.497
<b>We're all just pawns in a game,</b>

06:21.497 --> 06:24.947
<b>and none of you get how 
easily we're thrown out!</b>

06:25.267 --> 06:28.487
<b>Hey! You're out there 
somewhere listening, right?!</b>

06:28.487 --> 06:32.027
<b>"You can be free if you 
conquer the world," my ass!</b>

06:32.027 --> 06:34.567
<b>You deceived both me and 
the Demon Lord, dammit!</b>

06:34.567 --> 06:37.337
<b>You never planned on granting 
us that from the start!</b>

06:37.737 --> 06:40.787
<b>You're just as bad! King Ira Takuto!</b>

06:40.787 --> 06:42.987
<b>You're another Player too, aren't you?</b>

06:42.987 --> 06:46.197
<b>I bet you thought, "I need to upgrade 
my gear once I defeat this boss,"</b>

06:46.197 --> 06:48.477
<b>as you fought me too, didn't you?</b>

06:48.797 --> 06:50.167
<b>Well, fuck you!</b>

06:50.167 --> 06:51.477
<b>I'm here, and I exist!</b>

06:51.877 --> 06:57.647
<b>So I'm going to kill your little favorites 
now in my greatest act of spite!</b>

06:57.647 --> 06:59.327
<b>Hold on a moment!</b>

06:59.327 --> 07:00.237
<b>Wait!</b>

07:00.237 --> 07:02.007
<b>Hell no!</b>

07:02.007 --> 07:05.447
<b>I hate the whole lot of you.</b>

07:05.757 --> 07:06.987
<b>Mother...</b>

07:06.987 --> 07:08.997
<b>Maria! Caria!</b>

07:19.417 --> 07:21.157
<b>Is this the spot?</b>

07:21.157 --> 07:21.927
<b>Yeah!</b>

07:34.747 --> 07:38.137
<b>You found a wonderful spot, Big Sis.</b>

07:38.137 --> 07:41.897
<b>You can really see all of 
our king's nation from here.</b>

07:42.307 --> 07:47.017
<b>Our king said that his nation 
is also everyone's nation!</b>

07:47.017 --> 07:48.617
<b>So it's everyone's nation!</b>

07:49.007 --> 07:52.987
<b>Then that means it's our nation too.</b>

07:52.987 --> 07:53.687
<b>Yeah!</b>

07:53.687 --> 07:55.367
<b>And Mama Isla's too!</b>

07:55.367 --> 07:56.567
<b>Uh-huh.</b>

08:03.547 --> 08:05.177
<b>Wow.</b>

08:10.647 --> 08:12.477
<b>Look, Caria!</b>

08:13.007 --> 08:15.437
<b>It's so big and bright.</b>

08:15.937 --> 08:18.367
<b>The moon is pretty, isn't it?</b>

08:18.367 --> 08:20.087
<b>It is, but...?</b>

08:20.087 --> 08:21.397
<b>Our king told me.</b>

08:21.707 --> 08:24.077
<b>When you say, "The moon is pretty, isn't it?"</b>

08:24.077 --> 08:27.117
<b>it means "I love you."</b>

08:28.127 --> 08:29.977
<b>I've never heard of that before!</b>

08:29.977 --> 08:31.947
<b>Our king knows so much!</b>

08:32.327 --> 08:34.717
<b>I hadn't heard of it before, either.</b>

08:34.717 --> 08:36.997
<b>Our king knows everything.</b>

08:36.997 --> 08:38.397
<b>That's not fair!</b>

08:38.397 --> 08:43.717
<b>When did you get our king to teach 
you something so wonderful, Big Sis?</b>

08:54.417 --> 08:57.807
<b>Caria. The moon is pretty, isn't it?</b>

09:02.627 --> 09:06.237
<b>Big Sis, the moon is pretty!</b>

09:06.877 --> 09:10.187
<b>Next time, we should bring 
Mama Isla with us too.</b>

09:10.187 --> 09:13.197
<b>Everyone's nation looks so pretty from here.</b>

09:13.197 --> 09:18.437
<b>Then we can both tell her, "The 
moon is pretty, isn't it?!"</b>

09:18.437 --> 09:20.397
<b>Yeah! Let's do that!</b>

09:20.397 --> 09:22.267
<b>The night of the full moon would be best!</b>

09:22.267 --> 09:24.167
<b>So, on the next full moon!</b>

09:24.757 --> 09:27.337
<b>Yeah! We'll keep it secret until then!</b>

09:27.337 --> 09:29.597
<b>That's right, Big Sis!</b>

09:35.317 --> 09:36.047
<b>Huh?</b>

09:36.777 --> 09:37.767
<b>Huh?</b>

09:53.037 --> 09:56.897
<b>N-No!</b>

09:55.157 --> 09:57.997
<b>Mother! Mama Isla!</b>

09:57.997 --> 09:59.957
I'll take you down with me!

10:07.757 --> 10:11.757
<b>A-Are you two okay?</b>

10:12.917 --> 10:15.307
<b>Mother! Mother!</b>

10:15.787 --> 10:19.007
<b>You stayed safe then.</b>

10:19.747 --> 10:21.157
<b>Thank goodness.</b>

10:21.157 --> 10:23.477
<b>Truly, thank—</b>

10:23.477 --> 10:26.107
<b>Mother, I'm worried about your injuries!</b>

10:26.107 --> 10:29.357
<b>W-We need to get you to the 
king and the birdbrains fast!</b>

10:29.357 --> 10:31.447
<b>My king! My king!</b>

10:31.447 --> 10:34.617
Communication Error!

10:31.447 --> 10:34.617
Event in progress.

10:31.447 --> 10:34.617
You cannot use the chat function at this time.

10:34.617 --> 10:37.947
<b>My king! Why won't you respond to me?!</b>

10:38.237 --> 10:40.247
<b>Humans! Where are you?!</b>

10:40.247 --> 10:41.127
<b>Hurry!</b>

10:41.127 --> 10:42.167
<b>Get here quick!</b>

10:42.577 --> 10:45.467
<b>There's no need for treatment.</b>

10:47.457 --> 10:52.647
<b>I-I need you two to listen to 
what I'm about to say carefully.</b>

11:00.007 --> 11:02.527
<b>I'm sure you two already understand,</b>

11:02.527 --> 11:05.397
<b>but I won't survive.</b>

11:05.847 --> 11:11.357
<b>So there's something I wish 
to entrust to you two.</b>

11:11.357 --> 11:13.957
<b>No! We'll be good girls!</b>

11:13.957 --> 11:15.527
<b>So... So don't—</b>

11:15.527 --> 11:18.747
<b>T-There has to be some 
way to save you, Mother!</b>

11:19.027 --> 11:22.077
<b>I'm afraid there isn't.</b>

11:22.077 --> 11:24.407
<b>It's all because we were weak!</b>

11:24.407 --> 11:27.627
<b>It's all because we thought 
we could find happiness!</b>

11:27.627 --> 11:29.207
<b>That's why we're being punished!</b>

11:29.207 --> 11:30.417
<b>Why?!</b>

11:30.417 --> 11:32.677
<b>Why does everyone always die?!</b>

11:32.677 --> 11:35.177
<b>We just wanted to live with our mother!</b>

11:35.547 --> 11:39.137
<b>Have we really done something 
bad enough to deserve this?!</b>

11:39.767 --> 11:42.727
<b>You two have done nothing wrong.</b>

11:42.727 --> 11:45.987
<b>I was simply too weak.</b>

11:47.067 --> 11:49.857
<b>Mother, let us die with you.</b>

11:49.857 --> 11:51.737
<b>I can't stand this pain anymore.</b>

11:51.737 --> 11:55.067
<b>There's no point in living anymore.</b>

11:55.067 --> 11:57.697
<b>Nothing good ever comes out of life.</b>

11:58.017 --> 12:01.497
<b>Please listen to my last words.</b>

12:12.467 --> 12:16.717
<b>Please forgive your mother 
for passing on before you.</b>

12:16.717 --> 12:20.017
<b>Now, this is my final request...</b>

12:20.497 --> 12:22.177
<b>Please eat me,</b>

12:22.697 --> 12:24.767
<b>and live on.</b>

12:25.697 --> 12:26.547
<b>No!</b>

12:26.547 --> 12:27.597
<b>No, no!</b>

12:27.597 --> 12:28.717
<b>Why?!</b>

12:29.327 --> 12:30.857
<b>Why must we do that again?!</b>

12:31.137 --> 12:32.697
<b>Master.</b>

12:32.697 --> 12:35.217
<b>Please forgive my selfish action.</b>

12:35.217 --> 12:37.367
<b>I used the experience I acquired</b>

12:37.367 --> 12:40.827
<b>to learn the skill "Royal Succession."</b>

12:41.497 --> 12:43.827
<b>Maria, Caria.</b>

12:44.627 --> 12:49.627
<b>I'm handing down all of my power 
to the two of you.</b>

12:49.627 --> 12:55.087
<b>Please live your lives as you 
wish, my precious daughters.</b>

12:55.687 --> 12:57.457
<b>I love you!</b>

12:59.637 --> 13:01.457
<b>Mother!</b>

13:08.617 --> 13:10.897
<b>You don't need to
 come with me, you know.</b>

13:10.897 --> 13:13.027
<b>That's not true.</b>

13:13.027 --> 13:19.527
<b>Our king ordered me to march alongside you 
and destroy the Demon Lord's stronghold.</b>

13:22.927 --> 13:26.677
<b>I need to make haste back 
to King Takuto's side!</b>

13:27.207 --> 13:29.167
<b>And yet this trash...</b>

13:34.677 --> 13:35.867
<b>What a pain.</b>

13:38.207 --> 13:40.137
<b>N-No way!</b>

13:42.427 --> 13:44.037
<b>Is something the matter?!</b>

13:46.347 --> 13:47.657
<b>Look out!</b>

13:47.657 --> 13:49.977
<b>Everyone, duck!</b>

13:51.857 --> 13:53.527
<b>Impossible!</b>

13:53.527 --> 13:55.777
<b>She was a Hero!</b>

13:55.777 --> 14:00.237
<b>One of Mynoghra's Heroes!</b>

14:02.697 --> 14:03.927
<b>Lady Atou!</b>

14:03.927 --> 14:06.537
<b>Please quell your anger!</b>

14:12.217 --> 14:13.957
<b>I lost my composure.</b>

14:14.607 --> 14:17.217
<b>What happened?</b>

14:18.327 --> 14:19.677
<b>Isla was...</b>

14:21.257 --> 14:23.677
<b>No, that's impossible!</b>

14:24.207 --> 14:27.507
<b>Flamin's scripted event was famous,</b>

14:27.507 --> 14:30.547
<b>but that shouldn't have been 
possible in this world!</b>

14:31.557 --> 14:34.687
Communication Error!

14:31.557 --> 14:34.687
That Unit does not exist.

14:39.447 --> 14:45.197
"Isla, Queen of Bugs" has been destroyed.

14:39.447 --> 14:45.197
~One Threat has been removed from the world~

14:45.197 --> 14:49.037
Oh, Hero, I'm glad I was able to save you. 



This is where my life comes to an end.

14:49.037 --> 14:52.037
Please, accept my power...

15:16.687 --> 15:25.657
m 0 0 l 220 0 220 140 0 140

15:16.687 --> 15:25.657
The Hero—error—has awakened
 his true power!!!

