Promoting target's Status.

15:18.187 --> 15:25.657
Target's configuration profile is
 abnormal.

15:18.937 --> 15:25.657
Canceling Status promo...

15:19.687 --> 15:25.657
■■■■ haS 1nt3rV3N3d in th1S 
PR0c3ss.

15:20.447 --> 15:25.657
Continuing Status promotion.

15:21.197 --> 15:25.657
"Royal Succession" activated.

15:21.947 --> 15:25.657
Applying the skill "Hero" to 
the target.

15:22.697 --> 15:25.657
—error—There are duplicate
 targets for the awakening process.

15:23.447 --> 15:25.657
—error—Process could not be 
completed.

15:24.197 --> 15:25.657
—erro—Awakening completed.

15:42.377 --> 15:43.247
<b><i>Atou.</i></b>

15:44.117 --> 15:46.467
<b><i>What's going on, King Takuto?!</i></b>

15:46.727 --> 15:48.727
<b><i>Isla was defeated.</i></b>

15:48.727 --> 15:51.177
<b><i>She got caught in a death scene.</i></b>

15:51.487 --> 15:53.297
<b><i>That's impossible?!</i></b>

15:53.297 --> 15:55.397
<b>Dammit! That attack!</b>

16:01.637 --> 16:03.557
<b><i>What a grave blunder!</i></b>

16:03.557 --> 16:06.317
<b><i>I failed to report a crucial detail!</i></b>

16:08.707 --> 16:10.957
<b><i>Isla's defeat is an emergency.</i></b>

16:10.957 --> 16:12.787
<b><i>I'll return to the capital at once.</i></b>

16:12.787 --> 16:14.867
<b><i>I know, but hold on.</i></b>

16:15.167 --> 16:16.837
<b><i>Why, my king?!</i></b>

16:16.837 --> 16:18.907
<b><i>Isla is dead.</i></b>

16:18.907 --> 16:21.047
<b><i>Unfortunately, that's a fact.</i></b>

16:21.687 --> 16:24.007
<b><i>However, the twins have survived.</i></b>

16:24.597 --> 16:26.717
<b><i>Why are you bringing up the twins?</i></b>

16:27.147 --> 16:30.007
<b><i>They're moving south toward 
the enemy's stronghold.</i></b>

16:30.007 --> 16:32.407
<b><i>I imagine they're planning 
to exact vengeance.</i></b>

16:32.407 --> 16:34.437
<b><i>But those girls can't—</i></b>

16:34.717 --> 16:37.227
<b><i>Isla used Royal Succession</i></b>

16:37.227 --> 16:40.147
<b><i>to allow those two inherit her Hero status.</i></b>

16:41.897 --> 16:45.817
<b><i>We can't afford to lose any 
more Hero Units at this point.</i></b>

16:45.817 --> 16:47.587
<b><i>My orders won't reach them either,</i></b>

16:47.587 --> 16:49.867
<b><i>so I need you to retrieve them.</i></b>

16:50.137 --> 16:52.267
<b><i>If I may be so bold as to object,</i></b>

16:52.267 --> 16:54.567
<b><i>these RPG mechanics are a threat!</i></b>

16:54.567 --> 16:56.287
<b><i>I beg you to reconsider</i></b>

16:56.287 --> 16:59.187
<b><i>and grant me permission to protect you!</i></b>

16:59.187 --> 17:00.617
<b><i>I see.</i></b>

17:00.617 --> 17:02.547
<b><i>Even so, please go.</i></b>

17:02.547 --> 17:04.707
<b><i>Isla entrusted them to us.</i></b>

17:04.707 --> 17:07.847
<b><i>We can't afford to expose you 
to danger over sentimentality!</i></b>

17:07.847 --> 17:09.387
<b><i>King Takuto, you're my—</i></b>

17:09.387 --> 17:11.487
<b><i>Atou, this is an order.</i></b>

17:11.487 --> 17:12.967
<b><i>You're the only one I can ask.</i></b>

17:17.057 --> 17:19.897
<b><i>As you command, my king.</i></b>

17:20.167 --> 17:21.727
<b><i>Thank you, Atou.</i></b>

17:21.727 --> 17:23.357
<b><i>I trust you.</i></b>

17:25.107 --> 17:26.317
<b>Lady Atou?</b>

17:26.577 --> 17:28.857
<b>You all are to return to the capital.</b>

17:30.347 --> 17:32.567
<b>I forgot something very important.</b>

17:33.327 --> 17:36.917
<b><i>King Takuto was the greatest 
player of </i>Eternal Nations<i>.</i></b>

17:37.797 --> 17:41.197
<b><i>I just need to have faith in him and obey.</i></b>

17:42.877 --> 17:43.887
<b><i>My king!</i></b>

17:43.887 --> 17:47.397
<b><i>We'll soon be finished mopping up 
the survivors that entered our land.</i></b>

17:47.397 --> 17:49.517
<b><i>Shall we begin pursuing the others?</i></b>

17:49.517 --> 17:53.037
<b><i>All noncombatants will remain 
evacuated until tomorrow morning,</i></b>

17:53.037 --> 17:56.467
<b><i>at which point we'll begin repairs 
on the damaged facilities.</i></b>

17:56.467 --> 17:58.737
<b><i>You don't need to take action on your own.</i></b>

17:58.737 --> 18:02.047
<b><i>I'll issue the necessary 
orders at the necessary time.</i></b>

18:02.047 --> 18:03.827
<b><i>Please forgive my rudeness!</i></b>

18:03.827 --> 18:05.317
<b><i>My sincerest apologies!</i></b>

18:09.167 --> 18:11.367
<b>What's happened to our king?</b>

18:11.367 --> 18:14.367
<b>He almost feels like a 
different person right now...</b>

18:22.497 --> 18:25.707
<b>My, my, such a naughty girl!</b>

18:26.087 --> 18:28.547
<b>Did you come here knowing 
this was the defensive line</b>

18:28.547 --> 18:32.087
<b>of Lady Wind, the Tempest General 
of the Demon Lord's Army?</b>

18:35.227 --> 18:36.887
<b>All by yourself, no less?</b>

18:36.887 --> 18:39.267
<b>How courageous.</b>

18:39.267 --> 18:42.997
<b>Why do we have to
endure such suffering?</b>

18:42.997 --> 18:45.857
<b>Why do such awful things 
keep happening to us?</b>

18:46.347 --> 18:47.867
<b>Why is this world...</b>

18:48.427 --> 18:50.817
<b>so agonizing?</b>

18:57.447 --> 19:00.207
<b>Earth General, Old Mechanic!</b>

19:00.207 --> 19:02.417
<b>We've spotted an intruder.</b>

19:02.417 --> 19:03.957
<b>What shall we do?</b>

19:03.957 --> 19:06.957
<b>Ready our magitech. We'll eliminate her.</b>

19:06.957 --> 19:10.017
<b>The world hates us!</b>

19:10.017 --> 19:13.597
<b>It absolutely hates us!</b>

19:22.207 --> 19:23.497
<b>What did you do?!</b>

19:23.497 --> 19:27.727
<b>I knew something awful would happen 
to us if we relied on anyone else.</b>

19:27.727 --> 19:30.567
<b>I knew I never should have 
let myself hope for anything.</b>

19:30.567 --> 19:31.197
<b>Wha?!</b>

19:31.197 --> 19:34.157
<b>The world hates me.</b>

19:34.837 --> 19:35.947
<b>Dammit!</b>

19:35.947 --> 19:37.177
<b>Rage forth,</b>

19:37.177 --> 19:38.787
<b>Cursed Black Wind!</b>

19:40.537 --> 19:45.037
The Light of Divine Protection envelops the Hero.

19:40.537 --> 19:45.037
Caria nullifies the curse!

19:47.847 --> 19:48.867
<b>Huh?</b>

19:48.867 --> 19:50.007
<b>You're kidding, right?</b>

19:57.737 --> 19:59.467
<b>My face!</b>

20:02.907 --> 20:04.767
<b>H-Help me!</b>

20:17.997 --> 20:20.337
<b>Error detected in the magictech.</b>

20:20.337 --> 20:23.507
<b>Earth mage squad, go eliminate the enemy.</b>

20:26.427 --> 20:28.907
<b>There's a good chance we're under attack,</b>

20:28.907 --> 20:30.987
<b>though the nature of the attack in unclear.</b>

20:30.987 --> 20:32.217
<b>This is an emergency.</b>

20:32.517 --> 20:35.927
<b>Mechanical Armor, switch to auto-combat!</b>

20:38.407 --> 20:40.847
<b>Do you believe in love?</b>

20:40.847 --> 20:42.267
<b>Because love exists!</b>

20:43.767 --> 20:46.767
<b>Mechanical Armor has forgotten how to function.</b>

20:47.727 --> 20:48.887
<b>Wha?!</b>

20:49.537 --> 20:52.237
<b>Magitech, emergency forced start!</b>

20:52.237 --> 20:55.237
<b>Magitech has forgotten how to function.</b>

20:58.157 --> 20:59.987
<b>Earth Mages! Go!</b>

20:59.987 --> 21:03.037
<b>Earth Mages have forgotten how to function.</b>

21:06.867 --> 21:10.127
<b>Old Mechanic has forgotten offensive measures.</b>

21:11.707 --> 21:15.147
<b>This very world hates us,</b>

21:15.147 --> 21:17.507
<b>which is why we need love!</b>

21:20.927 --> 21:23.367
<b>We just eat and eat</b>

21:23.367 --> 21:26.297
<b>and the people we love force us to stay alive!</b>

21:34.777 --> 21:37.777
<b>Demon Lord! Please save me!</b>

21:37.777 --> 21:39.227
<b>When something's scary,</b>

21:39.227 --> 21:40.987
<b>you can just forget all about it!</b>

21:45.527 --> 21:47.287
<b>Because once you forget everything else,</b>

21:47.287 --> 21:49.177
<b>only love remains!</b>

21:59.967 --> 22:09.977
m 0 0 l 250 0 250 55 0 55

21:59.967 --> 22:09.977
*Emergency Announcement*
 A new Threat has emerged in the world.
 "The Elfuur Sisters, the Witches of Regret"

21:59.967 --> 22:09.977
~Fear the nights the moon shines bright.
 Fear the young girls harrowed by regret.
 For until their grief and loathing have reduced the 
world to ashes, their flames will never go out~

22:15.607 --> 22:18.277
<b>John Pickett 
Henry Lin 
Meagan Smith 
William Haggard 
Rei Miyasaka</b>

